{"assets":["/statement-assets/142de3458fda35030dc502580260767deef39f50aeba07c0993bb0d43d4bda2b.png","/statement-assets/68ea01a89b44efc9c71c90c7f604361908d2c9778309c39cdb662097dbbc36df.png","/statement-assets/505a9fb38806431e1e8c152167fb8b7a2e7afda60d8fba5a3cf5624bcf14926b.png","/statement-assets/ac70e4361779aa2f9ec9368e63f20c73c3246390a9fb28e392eb266ab9fe23c6.png","/statement-assets/030742d78bc1215471d697be3037f4e874abfb276b0065fbb0bf68fdcb565132.png","/statement-assets/7f3423ecf0fda70e2bce78e7505edee63c7076d7e6b41daecf761d232f6de8bc.png","/statement-assets/2d1a63bf0027bf74703bb41b1a62108f9900e3a3f0666baac6c6ee71f55dcaf5.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"715","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Plus and Square Root"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ZS the Coder is playing a game. There is a number displayed on the screen and there are two buttons, '"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" + "},{"kind":"text","text":"' (plus) and '"},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/142de3458fda35030dc502580260767deef39f50aeba07c0993bb0d43d4bda2b.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":"' (square root). Initially, the number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":" is displayed on the screen. There are "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n + 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" levels in the game and ZS the Coder start at the level "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"When ZS the Coder is at level "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":", he can :"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Press the '"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" + "},{"kind":"text","text":"' button"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". This increases the number on the screen by exactly "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":". So, if the number on the screen was "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":", it becomes "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x + k"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Press the '"},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/142de3458fda35030dc502580260767deef39f50aeba07c0993bb0d43d4bda2b.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":"' button"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". Let the number on the screen be "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":". After pressing this button, the number becomes "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/68ea01a89b44efc9c71c90c7f604361908d2c9778309c39cdb662097dbbc36df.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":". After that, ZS the Coder levels up, so his current level becomes "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k + 1"},{"kind":"text","text":". This button can only be pressed when "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" is a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"perfect square"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", i.e. "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = m2"},{"kind":"text","text":" for some positive integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Additionally, after each move, if ZS the Coder is at level "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":", and the number on the screen is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":", then "},{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" must be a multiple of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". Note that this condition is only checked after performing the press. For example, if ZS the Coder is at level "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4"},{"kind":"text","text":" and current number is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"100"},{"kind":"text","text":", he presses the '"},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/142de3458fda35030dc502580260767deef39f50aeba07c0993bb0d43d4bda2b.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":"' button and the number turns into "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"10"},{"kind":"text","text":". Note that at this moment, "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"10"},{"kind":"text","text":" is not divisible by "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4"},{"kind":"text","text":", but this press is still valid, because after it, ZS the Coder is at level "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"5"},{"kind":"text","text":", and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"10"},{"kind":"text","text":" is divisible by "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"5"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ZS the Coder needs your help in beating the game — he wants to reach level "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n + 1"},{"kind":"text","text":". In other words, he needs to press the '"},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/142de3458fda35030dc502580260767deef39f50aeba07c0993bb0d43d4bda2b.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":"' button "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" times. Help him determine the number of times he should press the '"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" + "},{"kind":"text","text":"' button before pressing the '"},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/142de3458fda35030dc502580260767deef39f50aeba07c0993bb0d43d4bda2b.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":"' button at each level. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Please note that ZS the Coder wants to find just any sequence of presses allowing him to reach level "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n + 1"},{"kind":"text","text":", but not necessarily a sequence minimizing the number of presses."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first and only line of the input contains a single integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 100 000"},{"kind":"text","text":"), denoting that ZS the Coder wants to reach level "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n + 1"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" non-negative integers, one per line. "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th of them should be equal to the number of times that ZS the Coder needs to press the '"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" + "},{"kind":"text","text":"' button before pressing the '"},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/142de3458fda35030dc502580260767deef39f50aeba07c0993bb0d43d4bda2b.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":"' button at level "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each number in the output should not exceed "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1018"},{"kind":"text","text":". However, the number on the screen "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"can be greater"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" than "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1018"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that at least one solution exists. If there are multiple solutions, print any of them."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"14\n16\n46\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"999999999999999998\n44500000000\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n17\n46\n97\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first sample case:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"On the first level, ZS the Coder pressed the '"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" + "},{"kind":"text","text":"' button "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"14"},{"kind":"text","text":" times (and the number on screen is initially "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":"), so the number became "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2 + 14·1 = 16"},{"kind":"text","text":". Then, ZS the Coder pressed the '"},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/142de3458fda35030dc502580260767deef39f50aeba07c0993bb0d43d4bda2b.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":"' button, and the number became "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/505a9fb38806431e1e8c152167fb8b7a2e7afda60d8fba5a3cf5624bcf14926b.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After that, on the second level, ZS pressed the '"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" + "},{"kind":"text","text":"' button "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"16"},{"kind":"text","text":" times, so the number becomes "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4 + 16·2 = 36"},{"kind":"text","text":". Then, ZS pressed the '"},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/142de3458fda35030dc502580260767deef39f50aeba07c0993bb0d43d4bda2b.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":"' button, levelling up and changing the number into "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/ac70e4361779aa2f9ec9368e63f20c73c3246390a9fb28e392eb266ab9fe23c6.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After that, on the third level, ZS pressed the '"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" + "},{"kind":"text","text":"' button "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"46"},{"kind":"text","text":" times, so the number becomes "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"6 + 46·3 = 144"},{"kind":"text","text":". Then, ZS pressed the '"},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/142de3458fda35030dc502580260767deef39f50aeba07c0993bb0d43d4bda2b.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":"' button, levelling up and changing the number into "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/030742d78bc1215471d697be3037f4e874abfb276b0065fbb0bf68fdcb565132.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note that "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"12"},{"kind":"text","text":" is indeed divisible by "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4"},{"kind":"text","text":", so ZS the Coder can reach level "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Also, note that pressing the '"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" + "},{"kind":"text","text":"' button "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"10"},{"kind":"text","text":" times on the third level before levelling up does not work, because the number becomes "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"6 + 10·3 = 36"},{"kind":"text","text":", and when the '"},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/142de3458fda35030dc502580260767deef39f50aeba07c0993bb0d43d4bda2b.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":"' button is pressed, the number becomes "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/ac70e4361779aa2f9ec9368e63f20c73c3246390a9fb28e392eb266ab9fe23c6.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" and ZS the Coder is at Level "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4"},{"kind":"text","text":". However, "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"6"},{"kind":"text","text":" is not divisible by "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4"},{"kind":"text","text":" now, so this is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"not a valid solution."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second sample case:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"On the first level, ZS the Coder pressed the '"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" + "},{"kind":"text","text":"' button "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"999999999999999998"},{"kind":"text","text":" times (and the number on screen is initially "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":"), so the number became "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2 + 999999999999999998·1 = 1018"},{"kind":"text","text":". Then, ZS the Coder pressed the '"},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/142de3458fda35030dc502580260767deef39f50aeba07c0993bb0d43d4bda2b.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":"' button, and the number became "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/7f3423ecf0fda70e2bce78e7505edee63c7076d7e6b41daecf761d232f6de8bc.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After that, on the second level, ZS pressed the '"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" + "},{"kind":"text","text":"' button "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"44500000000"},{"kind":"text","text":" times, so the number becomes "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"109 + 44500000000·2 = 9·1010"},{"kind":"text","text":". Then, ZS pressed the '"},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/142de3458fda35030dc502580260767deef39f50aeba07c0993bb0d43d4bda2b.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":"' button, levelling up and changing the number into "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/2d1a63bf0027bf74703bb41b1a62108f9900e3a3f0666baac6c6ee71f55dcaf5.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note that "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"300000"},{"kind":"text","text":" is a multiple of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":", so ZS the Coder can reach level "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"715A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/715/problem/A"}